{
  "id": "2SA.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "Samuu'Eel Labaad 19",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yoo'aab waxaa loo soo sheegay oo lagu yidhi, Bal eeg, boqorkii wuu u ooyayaa oo u anayaa Absaaloom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalintaas guushii waxay dadkii oo dhan ugu rogmatay baroor, waayo, maalintaas waxaa dadku maqlay in la yidhi, Boqorkii wiilkiisii buu u murugoonayaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkiina maalintaas qarsoodi bay ku soo galeen magaaladii, sidii dad ceebaysanu ay u dhuuntaan markii ay dagaalka ka cararaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii hagoogtay, oo cod weyn buu ku qayliyey oo yidhi, Wiilkaygii Absaaloomow, Absaaloomow, wiilkaygiiyow, wiilkaygiiyow! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yoo'aab boqorkii ugu yimid gurigiisii, oo ku yidhi, Maanta waxaad ceebaysay wejiyadii addoommadaada oo dhan, kuwaasoo maanta naftaada badbaadshay, iyo nafta wiilashaada iyo gabdhahaaga, iyo nafta naagahaaga, iyo nafta naagahaaga addoommaha ah; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo weliba waxaad jeceshahay kuwa ku neceb, kuwa ku jecelna waad neceb tahay. Waayo, maanta waxaad caddaysay inaanay amiirro iyo addoommoba waxba kula ahayn, maxaa yeelay, maanta waxaan ogaaday, haddii Absaaloom noolaan lahaa, oo aan annagu kulligayo dhiman lahayn, inaad taas aad ugu farxi lahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba saas daraaddeed kac, oo dibadda u bax, oo addoommadaada intaad la hadashid dhiiro geli; waayo, Rabbigaan ku dhaartaye, haddaadan dibadda u bixin, inaan ninna caawa kula joogayn; oo taasuna way kaaga sii xumaanaysaa kulli sharkii kugu dhacay tan iyo yaraantaadii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii sara joogsaday, oo iriddii buu fadhiistay. Oo taasaa loo sheegay dadkii oo dhan, oo lagu yidhi, Bal eega, boqorkii iridduu fadhiyaaye, markaasaa dadkii oo dhammu boqorkii hor yimaadeen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markii hore reer binu Israa'iil nin waluba wuxuu u cararay teendhadiisii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daa'uud Oo Ku Laabtay Yeruusaalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii oo dhan iyo qabiilooyinkii reer binu Israa'iil oo dhammu way isla doodayeen, oo waxay islahaayeen, War boqorku wuxuu inaga samatabbixiyey cadaawayaasheenna, reer Falastiinna wuu inaga badbaadshay, oo haatanna wuxuu dalka uga cararay Absaaloom aawadiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Absaaloomkii aynu u subkannay inuu inoo taliyana dagaalkii buu ku dhintay. Haddaba maxaad uga hadli weydeen si boqorka loo soo celiyo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii u cid diray wadaaddadii ahaa Saadooq iyo Aabyaataar, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Odayaasha dalka Yahuudah la hadla oo ku dhaha, Waxaa boqorka u yimid hadalkii reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan oo leh, Boqorka gurigiisa ha lagu soo celiyo, laakiinse maxaad idinku dadka uga hadheen si aad boqorka gurigiisii ugu soo celisaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "War idinku walaalahay baad tihiin, oo waxaad kaloo tihiin laftayda iyo luddayda; haddaba maxaad idinku dadka uga hadheen si aad boqorka gurigiisii ugu soo celisaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Camaasaana waxaad ku tidhaahdaan, War miyaadan ahayn laftayda iyo luddayda? Ilaah saas iyo si ka sii daran ha igu sameeyo, haddaan ciidanka sirkaal kaaga dhigi waayo, oo aadan had iyo goorba hortayda joogin meeshii Yoo'aab! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu soo jeediyey qalbigii dadkii dalka Yahuudah oo dhan, oo wuxuu ka dhigay sidii nin keliya qalbigiis; saas aawadeed waxay u soo cid direen boqorkii, oo ku yidhaahdeen, Adiga iyo addoommadaada oo dhammuba soo noqda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba boqorkii wuu noqday, oo wuxuu yimid Webi Urdun. Oo dadkii dalka Yahuudahna waxay yimaadeen Gilgaal inay boqorka ka hor tagaan, oo ay boqorka ka gudbiyaan Webi Urdun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Shimcii ina Geeraa oo ahaa reer Benyaamiin oo ka yimid Baxuuriim ayaa soo dhaqsaday oo ula soo dhaadhacay raggii reer Yahuudah inay Boqor Daa'uud ka hor tagaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa isaga la socday kun nin oo reer Benyaamiin ah, iyo Siibaa oo ahaa midiidinkii reerkii Saa'uul, iyo shan iyo tobankiisii wiil iyo labaatankiisii addoon; oo Webi Urdun bay dhex mareen isagoo boqorku arko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa waxaa gudubtay sixiimad in lagu soo tallaabiyo reer boqor iyo inuu sameeyo wixii isaga la wanaagsan. Oo Shimcii oo ahaa ina Geeraa ayaa ku dhacay boqorka hortiisii markuu Webi Urdun ka soo gudbay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu boqorkii ku yidhi, Sayidkaygiiyow, dembi ha igu tirin, oo ha xusuusan wixii aan anoo addoonkaaga ah si qalloocan kuugu sameeyey maalintii aad Yeruusaalem ka baxday, oo boqorow, sayidkaygiiyow, taas qalbiga ha ku qabsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, anigoo addoonkaaga ah haatan waan ogahay inaan dembaabay, oo sidaas daraaddeed ayaan maanta reer Yuusuf oo dhan ugu soo hor maray inaan soo dhaadhaco oo aan kaa hor imaado, boqorow, sayidkaygiiyow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse waxaa u jawaabay Abiishay oo ay Seruuyaah dhashay, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Shimcii miyuusan u dhimanayn waxan uu sameeyey, maxaa yeelay, wuxuu habaaray Rabbiga kiisii subkanaa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Daa'uud wuxuu yidhi, Kuwiinna ay Seruuyaah dhashayow, maxaa inaga dhexeeya? Oo maxaadse maanta cadaawayaal iigu noqoteen? Maanta reer binu Israa'iil ma nin baa laga dilayaa? Oo miyaanan anigu maanta ogayn inaan ahay boqor reer binu Israa'iil u taliya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii wuxuu Shimcii ku yidhi, Adigu dhiman maysid. Boqorkiina wuu u dhaartay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa waxaa yimid inuu boqorka ka hor tago Mefiiboshed oo ahaa ina Saa'uul; oo kaasu maalintii boqorku tegey iyo ilaa maalintii uu soo nabad noqday inta ka dhex leh cagihiisa ma uu hagaajin, gadhkiisiina ma uu jarin, dharkiisiina ma uu maydhin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markuu Yeruusaalem u yimid inuu boqorka ka hor tago ayaa boqorkii ku yidhi, Mefiiboshedow, maxaad ii raaci weyday? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu ku jawaabay, Boqorow, sayidkaygiiyow, waxaa i khiyaaneeyey addoonkaygii, waayo, anoo addoonkaagii ah waxaan is-idhi, Waxaan kooraysan dameer inaan fuulo aawadeed, markaasaan boqorka raaci doonaa, waayo, curyaan baan ahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo anigoo addoonkaagii ah ayuu igu kaa hor xantay boqorow, sayidkaygiiyow, laakiinse waxaad tahay sidii malaa'ig Ilaah oo kale; haddaba wixii kula wanaagsan samee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, reerka aabbahay oo dhammu waxay ahaayeen sida dad dhintay oo kale xaggaaga boqorow, sayidkaygiiyow, laakiinse anoo addoonkaaga ah waxaad i dhex fadhiisisay kuwa wax ka cuna miiskaaga. Haddaba weli xaqee baan u leeyahay inaan mar dambe kuu qayshado, boqorow? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boqorkiina wuxuu ku yidhi, War maxaad weli uga sii hadlaysaa axwaalahaaga? Waxaan ku leeyahay, Adiga iyo Siibaa dhulka qaybsada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Mefiiboshed wuxuu boqorkii ku yidhi, Isagu ha iska wada qaato, mar haddaad gurigaaga ku soo nabad noqotay, boqorow, sayidkaygiiyow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Barsillay oo ahaa reer Gilecaad ayaa Rogeliim ka yimid; oo wuxuu boqorka kala gudbay Webi Urdun, si uu u sii sagootiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barsillayna nin aad u da' weyn buu ahaa, oo wuxuu jiray siddeetan sannadood, oo boqorkana sooryuu u keeni jiray intuu Maxanayim joogay, maxaa yeelay, nin aad u weyn buu ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii wuxuu Barsillay ku yidhi, Kaalay oo ila gudub, oo anna Yeruusaalem baan kugu quudin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barsillayna wuxuu boqorkii ku yidhi, Bal cimrigaygu waa intee, markaan boqorka Yeruusaalem u raacayo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maanta waxaan jiraa siddeetan sannadood, haddaba miyaan kala garan karaa xumaanta iyo samaanta? Oo anigoo addoonkaaga ah miyaan dhadhamin karaa waxaan cuno iyo waxaan cabbo toona? Oo miyaan in dambe maqli karaa codka ragga gabyaya iyo dumarka heesaya? Haddaba anoo addoonkaaga ah maxaan culays kuugu noqonayaa, boqorow, sayidkaygiiyow? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anoo addoonkaaga ah waxaan doonayay inaan Webi Urdun kaala gudbo oo keliya; haddaba maxaad abaalgudkan weyn iigu soo celinaysaa, boqorow? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba anoo addoonkaaga ah, waan ku baryayaaye, i daa aan dib u noqdee, si aan ugu dhinto magaaladaydii iyo meel u dhow qabrigii aabbahay iyo hooyaday. Laakiinse bal eeg addoonkaagii Kimhaam; isagu ha kula gudbo, boqorow, sayidkaygiiyow, oo isaga ku samee wax alla wixii kula wanaagsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii wuxuu ku jawaabay, Kimhaam aniguu ila gudbayaa, oo waxaan u samaynayaa wixii kula wanaagsan; oo wax alla wixii aad i weyddiisato, waan kuu samaynayaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii oo dhammu Webi Urdun bay ka gudbeen, oo boqorkiina wuu gudbay; boqorkiina Barsillay wuu dhunkaday, wuuna u duceeyey; oo isna wuxuu ku noqday meeshiisii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaasuu boqorkii ugu gudbay Gilgaal, oo Kimhaamna isaguu la gudbay, oo reer Yahuudah oo dhammuna boqorkii bay soo gudbiyeen, iyo reer binu Israa'iil badhkood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dabadeedna dadkii reer binu Israa'iil oo dhammu boqorkii bay u yimaadeen, oo waxay boqorkii ku yidhaahdeen, Walaalaheen oo ah ragga reer Yahuudah maxay kuu xadeen, oo ay adiga iyo reerkaagaba Webi Urdun idiinku tallaabiyeen iyo weliba raggaagii kula jirayba, boqorow? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa raggii reer Yahuudah waxay ugu jawaabeen raggii reer binu Israa'iil, War boqorku annaguu na hilib xigaa, ee maxaad xaaladdan ugu cadhoonaysaan? War ma annagaa boqorka wax ka cunnay? Mase hadiyad buu na siiyey? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo raggii reer binu Israa'iilna waxay raggii reer Yahuudah ugu jawaabeen, War boqorka toban meelood baannu ku leennahay, oo weliba Daa'uud annagaa idinkaga xaq leh, haddaba maxaad noo quudhsateen oo aad hore noo weyddiin weydeen talo ku saabsan boqorkeenna soo celintiisa? Oo raggii reer Yahuudah erayadoodii way ka sii adkaayeen erayadii raggii reer binu Israa'iil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
